{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-02-03 08:00:00', 'title': 'WOLTERS KLUWER COMPLIANCE SOLUTIONS PARTNERS WITH BROADRIDGE TO OFFER INDUSTRY-LEADING COST BASIS SOLUTION', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #BROADRIDGE--A NEW WOLTERS KLUWER/BROADRIDGE ALLIANCE ENABLES TAX REPORTING DATA SHARING DIRECTLY BETWEEN BPS CLIENTS AND THE GAINSKEEPER COST BASIS SOLUTION.'}{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-02-03 07:00:00', 'title': "BROADRIDGE AMONG FORTUNE MAGAZINE'S 2022 'WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES'", 'text': "NEW YORK, FEB. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FORTUNE® MAGAZINE HAS AGAIN NAMED\xa0BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE: BR) TO ITS LIST OF THE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES IN THE FINANCIAL DATA SERVICES INDUSTRY. THE FORTUNE LIST, CONSIDERED ONE OF THE LEADING MEASURES OF CORPORATE REPUTATION AMONG THE WORLD'S LARGEST COMPANIES, RATES FIRMS ON A RANGE OF CRITERIA FROM INVESTMENT VALUE TO GLOBAL COMPETITIVENESS AND INNOVATION."}